# Trusted Ed25519 public keys (hex) for signed watt-connect catalog snapshots.
# One key per line. This file is compiled into the watt-connect binary.
#
# The matching private key is NEVER committed. It lives only in the
# CATALOG_SIGNING_KEY secret used by .github/workflows/catalog-publish.yml.
#
# Generate a key pair with:
#   cargo run -p watt-connect-catalog -- keygen
# then paste the printed public key below. Until a key is listed here,
# watt-connect only uses the catalog snapshot bundled into the binary and
# rejects every remotely fetched catalog.
